# ============================================
# GitHub repo (didhd/bedrock-model-catalog-api-v2) is PUBLIC.
# Allow source code, block build artifacts and secrets.
# ============================================

# Block everything by default
/*

# Allow source/docs
!README.md
!SPEC.md
!.gitignore
!.github/
!.github/**
!docs/
!docs/**
!skills/
!skills/**
!skills-lock.json

# Allow Lambda source
!lambda/
lambda/*
!lambda/handler.py
!lambda/requirements.txt
!lambda/fallback_metadata.json
!lambda/fallback_pricing.json

# Allow local collector
!local_collect.py

# Allow Terraform source (BUT block state and vars)
!terraform/
terraform/*
!terraform/*.tf
!terraform/terraform.tfvars.example

# Frontend excluded (managed in separate repo)

# Always block secrets and build artifacts (defense in depth)
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/lambda.zip
**/layer.zip
**/package/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfvars
**/tfplan
